  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Workshop Lake Tanganyika Regional Corridor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Lake Tanganyika Regional Corridor Assessment carried out in 2021 provided a regional perspective on the development of maritime transport corridors and presented a possible agenda for the development of the Tanganyika Regional Corridor. The objective of the workshop is to present and discuss this study with regional stakeholders and to develop a roadmap by proposing priorities, objectives and actions that must be taken into account in order further develop the Tanganyika corridor based on a shared vision, supported by all relevant stakeholders.</narrative>
  </description>
